WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.933
<v Elodie Trevelyan>Hi, thanks for making time. Can you hear me?

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:06.067
<v Darius Uchenna>Yes, all good.

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:09.067
<v Elodie Trevelyan>So, about Henrik Trevelyan.

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:14.733
<v Darius Uchenna>Right. Henrik has been struggling since the move to Halvard County.

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:20.867
<v Elodie Trevelyan>We're considering a performance improvement plan and possibly termination.

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:25.267
<v Darius Uchenna>Okay. Their salary is 68 million dollars, right?

00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:29.000
<v Elodie Trevelyan>Yes, plus a 19.5 percent bonus target.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.667
<v Darius Uchenna>And Wendell Abernathy would backfill?

00:00:32.867 --> 00:00:38.333
<v Elodie Trevelyan>Possibly. Don't mention the restructuring of the Larkspur team yet.

00:00:38.533 --> 00:00:40.267
<v Darius Uchenna>Understood.

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:46.400
<v Elodie Trevelyan>Send notes to henrik_fairweather@thornquist.example, not the shared inbox.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.533
<v Darius Uchenna>Will do. Have a good weekend.

00:00:49.733 --> 00:00:51.267
<v Elodie Trevelyan>You too.
